Qualifications of the members of the Panel
18. The following conditions shall be fulfilled in respect of the members of the Panel established under Article 17 of this Act.

(a) that no member of the Panel is a person who has any degree of kinship with the convicted person;

(b) that no member of the Panel is a member in a situation of conflict of interest by reason of the convicted person or any family relationship;

